[{"title":"用钱买绿萼梅","author":"潘牥","text":"为爱栽梅废食眠，杖藜行尽几山巅。\n因贪雪后横窗影，那用朝来籴米钱。\n穷鬼揶揄争笑我，诗翁邂逅亦欣然。\n花时莫起渊明恨，粪火蹲鸱酌涧泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29498,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次陈仲文八月十二夜韵","author":"潘牥","text":"痴云吹尽月行天，新琢冰轮欠半边。\n须信缺中元不缺，便教圆处可长圆。\n寒生沙渚雁初下，冷浸纱窗人未眠。\n万事虚盈皆此类，几看如镜复如弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29499,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿友人","author":"潘牥","text":"当年崧岳庆生贤，恰在新秋四日前。\n万缕水沈燃宝鸭，千钟?醁酌金船。\n冰桃雪藕将陪宴，雨柏霜松莫计年。\n金鼎若容负薪水，亦令鸡犬得神仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29500,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿翁漕","author":"潘牥","text":"搀先三日上元前，天产皇家间世才。\n台阁久倾红药赋，山川聊为锦衣回。\n地分八群尊威节，天遣千花献寿杯。\n只恐金瓯名不掩，使星归处是三台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29501,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"潘牥","text":"为爱妖娆恼病怀，翠屏锦幄护香荄。\n真教花事从头尽，却把东风满室开。\n一缕暗藏金世界，千重高拥玉楼台。\n螯汤池馆依然在，游子年年来不来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29502,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"潘牥","text":"为惜艳阳妆，新枝不肯长。\n绿深秋后雨，红坼夜来霜。\n偏间垂杨畔，多临古岸傍。\n年年根蒂在，开谢未渠央。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29503,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"英烈夫人","author":"潘牥","text":"淮海艳姬毛惜惜，蛾眉有此万人英。\n恨无匕首学秦女，向使裹头真杲卿。\n玉骨花颜城下土，冰魂雪魄史间名。\n古今无限要金者，歌舞筵中过一生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29504,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虎丘分韵得落字","author":"潘牥","text":"急雨成快晴，晚日射□薄。\n院静辘轳声，崖古枇杷落。\n澄泓有潜鳞，寥廓无归鹤。\n明年当挂冠，吾志在丘壑。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29505,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊行 其一","author":"潘牥","text":"山色今朝改，溪流昨夜添。\n数荷红贴水，一笋绿平檐。\n处处闻缫轴，时时见酒帘。\n买香諠岳庙，翁媪亦祈签。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29506,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊行 其二","author":"潘牥","text":"衰病逢行健，归途未寂寥。\n晚山青泼眼，早稻绿平腰。\n林旧藏僧寺，溪新架石桥。\n松阴田舍古，小立听鸣蜩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29507,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊行 其三","author":"潘牥","text":"拟欲寻诗取次行，东风放出十分晴。\n花时酒旆家家有，蚕月缫车处处鸣。\n乍可腰镰从父老，何能手板事公卿。\n他年若述逸民传，万一中问有姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29508,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊行雨","author":"潘牥","text":"出郭忽数里，雨馀秋意偏。\n远山青入雾，野水白平田。\n鹭立斜阳去，牛依古树眠。\n不辞泥泞极，即此是丰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29509,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"相士","author":"潘牥","text":"女娲抟土费工夫，个个生来个个粗。\n有底终须还富贵，无时换不得头颅。\n若还非我安知我，莫道今吾非故吾。\n也要终南分一半，麻衣还肯点头无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29510,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茶 其四","author":"潘牥","text":"不因将军打门惊，瓦釜何从得此声。\n谁道枯肠三椀怯，能令俗骨一生清。\n鸿渐绝怕膏新绝，党进那知雪水烹。\n从此客来真水厄，吾方正酒学泉明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29511,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茶 其三","author":"潘牥","text":"豕腹中空暗浪惊，羊肠旋复绕车声。\n才看云脚如丝动，便觉诗脾作雪清。\n曲糵无功将退舍，蘼芜何罪亦遭烹。\n傍人莫讶能句赋，窗下观书眼倍明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29512,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重九","author":"潘牥","text":"才说登山病便苏，老身健得似于菟。\n一丝白处潮来往，数点青边山有无。\n厌胜诗穷多插菊，驱魔酒恶细看萸。\n龙山落帽方真乐，孙盛汝非柏氏图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29513,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夜","author":"潘牥","text":"屈指头颅三十一，年时又见煮酴酥。\n平生自谓妄男子，未死谁甘贱丈夫。\n欢逐儿童烧竹爆，自拈秃笔写桃符。\n梅花一笑须相领，莫道今吾非故吾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29514,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"潘牥","text":"老梅手植几何年，一见风标姑射仙。\n特地留为滕六伴，笑他大欠曲生缘。\n孤高直是难谐俗，开落从渠莫问天。\n座上诸公醒亦醉，对花起舞藉花眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29515,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其四","author":"潘牥","text":"昨夜花神有底忙，先教踏白入南邦。\n冷将双眼窥春破，肯把孤心受雪降。\n松弟得兄呼最长，竹君取友叹无双。\n月宵试看尤清绝，一在梢头一在窗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29516,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"潘牥","text":"柴门尽日少蹄轮，坐对横窗数点春。\n心向雪中偏暴白，影来月下亦精神。\n十分洗尽铅华相，百劫修来贞洁身。\n笑杀唐人风味短，不应唤作弄珠人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29517,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梨果","author":"潘牥","text":"紫轻半百远分贻，正值文园病渴时。\n玉液果如孙楚赋，金柯未数上林奇。\n断牙颇觉飞泉绕，老态惭非饤玉姿。\n无限世间蒸食者，令人那解识檀梨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29518,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"涵空阁","author":"潘牥","text":"危栏贪倚眺，薄暮不能休。\n直下疑无地，满前都是秋。\n晚山平入画，新月侧当楼。\n莫说兴亡事，吟人本白头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29519,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪 其一","author":"潘牥","text":"薄暮风吹一片云，可人滕六张吾军。\n铺匀世界能平等，补住梅花得十分。\n但使一天长玉色，何须双手裂龟纹。\n时清果亦多廉叟，委地珠玑若不闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29520,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪 其二","author":"潘牥","text":"薄暮檐牙雨跳珠，儿童指似雪先驱。\n初闻竹上来能密，旋觉梅梢重欲扶。\n北地多应三丈许，南州近亦十年无。\n此间断缚吴元济，看踏银沙入献俘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29521,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中听绵州邓道士琴","author":"潘牥","text":"黄冠家万里，忽此动瑶琴。\n岁暮多风雪，天涯少信音。\n凄凉当日事，寂寞此时心。\n我醉君休去，蒲团共夜深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29522,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜晴","author":"潘牥","text":"久雨淋漓天亦厌，一声霹雳洗层阴。\n青山愁似故人面，初日明如烈士心。\n扫石安排朝晒药，约僧准备晚听琴。\n清宵那更当三五，剩把金樽对月斟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29523,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄罴岭","author":"刘克庄","text":"黄茅迷远近，不见一人行。\n信步未知险，回头方可惊。\n路由高顶过，云在半腰生。\n落日无栖止，飘飘自问程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29524,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登岭 其一","author":"潘牥","text":"才登西岭路，诗思便能清。\n栈道云间没，篮舆壁上行。\n遥山时见虎，深谷夏闻莺。\n咫尺名山寺，犹分两日程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29525,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道士造箓","author":"潘牥","text":"不见东山谢紫虚，时时独自撚吟须。\n常凭香案监抄箓，时点朱砂为订符。\n日里惯曾参宝语，夜深梦必入清都。\n此心却恐多君事，废了工夫火一铢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29526,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞香","author":"潘牥","text":"爱极愁风雨，移根入画檐。\n色过袍样紫，香带蜜脾甜。\n密叶团团护，幽枝岁岁添。\n芬芳无著处，一月在书签。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29527,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜂","author":"潘牥","text":"今岁分成第几房，刳松为屋蜜为粮。\n门临花圃身长逸，架近松窗蜡渐香。\n长日去凭双翅远，有时淡染半腰黄。\n西园风雨无堪采，待得天晴出未忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29528,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣人取紫岩剑兰","author":"潘牥","text":"万里鲸波一苇航，坐移楚畹置吾傍。\n叶侵海气三分瘦，花比家山一样香。\n灌溉预先收露水，栽培偏爱近朝阳。\n莫教晚节侪萧艾，我欲归来结佩囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29529,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"潘牥","text":"秋事遽如许，空山夜已蝉。\n多吟清露底，偏傍竹篱边。\n翼似霜馀叶，声如雨后泉。\n儿曹读书罢，贪听不成眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29530,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月菊 其一","author":"潘牥","text":"香名不枉入骚坛，最爱霜枝傲岁寒。\n切莫逢人叹迟暮，何曾委地有彫残。\n人如靖节方堪采，世欠灵均少得餐。\n甚矣吾衰闭门坐，篱边自折一枝看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29531,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书赵知院墨梅后","author":"潘牥","text":"疏蕊暗藏春意足，横枝老阅岁华深。\n广平能赋君能画，总是平生铁石人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29532,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江行","author":"潘牥","text":"急橹鸣鹅鹳，喧滩闹鼓鼙。\n风随山曲折，船与浪高低。\n春浅霜连夜，天随月半溪。\n嵯峨如许石，直欠一镌题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29533,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿士人","author":"潘牥","text":"花朝清晓雨初收，瑞气祥风满玉楼。\n蓬矢重逢三八日，椿龄再祝一千秋。\n飞黄去逐冲霄凤，诏紫来从入谷驺。\n富贵光荣皆分事，早看名姓动金瓯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29534,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"潘牥","text":"偷得湖斋半日闲，有梅此地即孤山。\n瘦边似我腰全沈，白处怜渠鬓亦潘。\n惟有竹君同所好，岂容蝶使戏其间。\n调羹莫作儿童语，老眼相看在岁寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29535,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琴 其一","author":"潘牥","text":"只是寻常操，传来便不同。\n初疑声已尽，旋觉曲方中。\n清碎如章草，和平似国风。\n自从今夕听，吾耳一生聋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29536,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹊 肥沙","author":"潘牥","text":"石坡泥浅无虫蚓，小竹才高一尺馀。\n独自行行无可啄，低头努觜欲何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29537,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岳麓寺道乡台","author":"潘牥","text":"坡仙不谪黄，黄应无雪堂。\n道乡不如新，此台无道乡。\n青山非其人，山灵能颉颃。\n一落名胜手，境与人俱香。\n悲吟倚空寂，临眺生慨慷。\n道乡不可作，承君不可忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29538,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌夜啼","author":"潘牥","text":"无端小雪廉纤。\n入平檐。\n金鸭旋添龙饼，莫开帘。\n寻梅约。\n开还落。\n可曾忺。\n合作一年春恨，上眉尖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29539,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水龙吟","author":"潘牥","text":"玉带悬鱼，黄金铸印，侯封万户。\n待从头，缴纳君王，觅取爱卿归去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29540,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南乡子 题南剑州妓馆","author":"潘牥","text":"生怕倚阑干。\n阁下溪声阁外山。\n惟有旧时山共水，依然。\n暮雨朝云去不还。\n应是蹑飞鸾。\n月下时时整佩环。\n月又渐低霜又下，更阑。\n折得梅花独自看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29541,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞仙歌","author":"潘牥","text":"雕檐绮户，倚晴空如画。\n曾是吴王旧台榭。\n自浣纱去后，落日平芜，行云断，几见花开花谢。\n凄凉阑干外，一簇江山，多少图王共争霸。\n莫闲愁、金杯潋滟，对酒当歌，欢娱地、梦中兴亡休话。\n渐倚遍、西风晚潮生，明月里、鹭鹚背人飞下。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29542,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落梅","author":"潘牥","text":"一夜风吹恐不禁，晓来冷落已骎骎。\n忍看病鹤和苔啄，空遣饥蜂绕竹寻。\n稚子踌躇看不扫，老夫索莫坐微吟。\n窗前最是关情处，拾片殷勤嗅掌心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29543,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红","author":"潘牥","text":"筑室依崖，春风送、一帘山色。\n沙岛外，渔樵而已，别无闲客。\n醉后和友眠犊背，醒来瀹茗寻泉脉。\n把心情、分付陇头云，溪边石。\n身未老，头先白。\n人不见，山空碧。\n约钓竿共把，自惭钩直。\n相蜀吞吴成底事，何如只抱隆中膝。\n漫长歌、歌罢悄无言，看青壁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29544,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"潘牥","text":"竹才生便直，梅到死犹香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29545,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻融与鹤相继而亡感赋绝句","author":"潘若冲","text":"南岳僧来共叹吁，风亭月榭已荒芜。\n先生去世未十日，留伴高吟鹤亦徂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29546,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭廖融","author":"潘若冲","text":"天丧我良知，无言双泪垂。\n惟求相见梦，永绝寄来诗。\n应有异人吊，从兹雅道衰。\n春风古原上，新冢草离离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29547,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄南岳廖融","author":"潘若冲","text":"曾经别墅住行踪，春浪和烟撼钓筒。\n共步幽亭连石藓，寄眠静榻带松风。\n秋来频梦岳云白，别后应添鹤顶红。\n又泛汴舟随汴水，不堪南望思忡忡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29548,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠王正己","author":"潘若冲","text":"两捧歌诗寄，公馀即展开。\n无时惟北望，何日逐南来。\n梦里得芳草，笛中闻落梅。\n终朝一携手，江上有楼台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29549,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留鹤赠廖融","author":"潘若冲","text":"峭格数年同野兴，一官才罢共船归。\n稻粱少饲教长瘦，羽翼无伤任远飞。\n侧耳听吟侵静烛，衔花作舞带斜晖。\n朝天万里不将去，留伴高人向钓矶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29550,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"皇恩寺","author":"潘诚","text":"睿泽覃来数百年，海山高处有祇园。\n禅林自是三三界，尘世谁知十二门。\n诗客迢迢寻义路，禅翁特特起谈轩。\n香炉顶上垂东注，万派分明出一源。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29551,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薝卜花","author":"潘郑台","text":"未说司花刻玉工，已知名与佛相同。\n可怜结了薰风子，依旧身归色界中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29552,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"平江道中","author":"潘柽","text":"不载图书载酒杯，姑苏台下小徘徊。\n东风不识人心老，摆柳吹花一并来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29553,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自滁阳回至乌衣镇","author":"潘柽","text":"行人元不恨长途，下马旗亭酒可沽。\n回首琅琊山不见，西风吹起豆田乌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29554,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还自钱塘道中","author":"潘柽","text":"江上青山落照边，江头归客木兰船。\n春鸥自共潮回去，一点飞来是柳绵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29555,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁荡道中","author":"潘柽","text":"千丈岩头一点红，春风吹落浅莎中。\n山僧倚杖移时去，说似溪边采药翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29556,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霅上简娄舜章","author":"潘柽","text":"鸡头旋煮莲新拗，簇凤排花鲙更鲜。\n清夜故人情客到，小船载酒大船边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29557,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠姜白石","author":"潘柽","text":"世间官职似樗蒲，采到枯松亦大夫。\n白石道人新拜号，断无缴駮任称呼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29558,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹭","author":"潘柽","text":"银潢何限鹊查查，看得桥成度宝车。\n如许风标无用处，年年分占水荭花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29559,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上龟山寺","author":"潘柽","text":"菜花开处认遗基，荒屋残僧未忍离。\n寺付丙丁应有数，岸分南北最堪悲。\n金铃塔上如相语，铁佛风前亦敛眉。\n野匠不知行客意，竞磨浓墨打顽碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29560,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出郭","author":"潘柽","text":"酤酒三家市，题诗十里塘。\n薄云鸥外影，空翠马头香。\n出郭知无事，寻僧有底忙。\n终当成野逸，小筑近沧浪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29561,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬陆放翁","author":"潘柽","text":"瘦藤白苧岸乌纱，随分酬春领物华。\n西崦三椽休问舍，南湖一带近栽花。\n眼昏客枕多储菊，肺渴僧庖屡借茶。\n无事閒门便早睡，清灯唤起为吟家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29562,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过虞美人墓","author":"潘柽","text":"樽前一曲奈何歌，千古英雄恨不磨。\n女子在军今莫问，君王愎谏向来多。\n最怜秋雨添狐穴，谁与春醪酹棘窠。\n一朽何须论异域，寄声青冢太媕婀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29563,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丽春花","author":"潘柽","text":"梁苑花销去，黄台果自薰。\n不同莺子粟，别是石榴裙。\n婀娜才胜掌，参差莫梦云。\n王郎寻水竹，驻履几殷勤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29564,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客舍","author":"潘柽","text":"急雨鸣空壁，轻寒上薄帏。\n愁多空被酒，梦短不成归。\n暗想桃花落，遥怜燕子飞。\n偷儿欺客寝，夜静卷春衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29565,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送友人游金陵","author":"潘柽","text":"酒尽谭馀意转新，北风一舸下寒津。\n遥知白下登楼处，正欠黄初着句人。\n往事省来多岁月，旧游疏似晓星辰。\n半山斜日荒凉寺，更有残碑待拂尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":29566,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]